{"id":4983,"title":{"romaji":"Tensei shita Dai Seijo wa, Seijo de Aru Koto wo Hita Kakusu","english":"A Tale of the Secret Saint","native":"転生した大聖女は、聖女であることをひた隠す"},"slug":"tensei_shita_dai_seijo_wa_seijo_de_aru_koto_wo_hita_kakusu","synopsis":"Fia always dreamed of becoming a knight. Born into a family of knights, she’s the least talented among them, but she still clutches to her hope and trains with everything she has. When the day comes for her to slay a small demon and prove her worth, she ends up face to face with a dragon instead! A deadly injury makes her life flash before her eyes…and she suddenly remembers her former life, when she was a powerful Saint in a bygone era who defeated the Demon King. That life ended in pain because of who she was, making her fear ever becoming a Saint again. Now that the magic from her previous life has been rekindled, she may become a more powerful knight than she ever dreamed–if only she can survive long enough!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2026,"createdAt":"2026-10-03 22:48:24","updatedAt":"2026-10-03 22:48:46","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":187402},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":25420},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":19201},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":13073},{"site":"MAL","externalId":61153},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":35013},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":50850}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":13813,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/Z3zuBSrvOJoWpPyaKvETvjowtwkO1QLPqb1D3JNy.avif"},{"id":13814,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/2rVAHkWBhy0IilJNTdyawoNkQCtBAxh4C1XgDUL1.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":150,"name":"Felix Film","slug":"felix_film"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":14779,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":14669,"title":{"romaji":"Flare of Soul","native":"Flare of Soul"}},"anim